                "entry_id": "3de83b94-66e0-324a-828c-a2e08d73dc2d",
                "word": "bumpity",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "de18bfe0-6119-39fa-b9f8-2b52a122253d",
                        "entry_id": "3de83b94-66e0-324a-828c-a2e08d73dc2d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Nonce variation of the word bump, usually indicating the sound of someone or something tumbling down an uneven surface, or traveling on a rough road."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e75dc648-c998-4ad6-9722-e122db00c339",
                                "sense_id": "de18bfe0-6119-39fa-b9f8-2b52a122253d",
                                "text": "\"There he goes!\" cried his delighted master, throwing down the poker and snapping his fingers in an ecstasy — \"Bumpity bump! bumpity bump! Hope he won't stop at the landing-place — no — off again! All stone steps!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "072440dd-dc61-4425-a173-4fdb045352ca",
                                "sense_id": "de18bfe0-6119-39fa-b9f8-2b52a122253d",
                                "text": "Daria closed her eyes, exhaling slow smoke through her nostrils, listening to the bumpity sound of wheels on the polished cobblestone unevenness of the street."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b90ede66-aba4-4925-8a4d-0286e69a6888",
                                "sense_id": "de18bfe0-6119-39fa-b9f8-2b52a122253d",
                                "text": "The rhythmic bumpity, bumpity, bumpity bump of a pissed academic with arthritic knees falling down the stairs, ricocheting between wall and banister as he went."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "170cec02-0c9a-42bb-92fd-a722bdb59421",
                                "sense_id": "de18bfe0-6119-39fa-b9f8-2b52a122253d",
                                "text": "Bang, bang, bumpity bump, I hear as spruce cones fall on the metal roofing of my woodshed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f4bc74e-5b74-42eb-8628-cc7b230475ab",
                                "sense_id": "de18bfe0-6119-39fa-b9f8-2b52a122253d",
                                "text": "\"I've always wanted romance, and I realized I'd had it with her. It made my heart go all bumpity-bump. Then she called me her light, and that was that.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
